"},"body":"Fixes #103970 \r\n\r\nThis function attempts to calculate the class a script inherits from, but it fails if the path is relative and the script is in a subdirectory since it uses the current working directory. Moving the resolution of the relative path earlier solves the problem.\r\n\r\nThis also fixes the script create dialog, which had the same problem, and probably other things since this is also used in editor_file_system.cpp. \r\n\r\nThis change is inside a block of code with [a comment](https://github.com/precup/godot/blob/ee56228d0b3bef90d6c9fc8c7829316d6ca5ccfb/modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp#L2842) that says \"WARNING... Before changing this function, please ask the current maintainer of EditorFileSystem.\"","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104014/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104014/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}